# L9d (L9-PAINT): a landscape spline paints a weight layer under the road (UE ULandscapeSplineSegment::LayerName +
# ULandscapeSplineControlPoint::LayerWidthRatio): the Splines edit layer carries the paint, merged OVER the paint below.
# Start: L9.scn's road - three points across the TerrainPlain hill at (6300|9282|12300, -1906), Width 400, falloff 300.
# The landscape has one paint layer (Ground); 'Create Layer Info' adds 'Layer N' (a swatch colour, no albedo -> its
# LayerUsageDebugColor draws flat). 'Spline paint layer: next' walks the landscape's layers: Ground, then Layer N.
# The scenario SAVES: `git checkout -- Projects/Desert/Content/Scenes/G3_TwoTerrains*` and delete the new Layer N
# .delayerinfo after a play.
Дано run Scene "Open Scene G3_TwoTerrains.desce"
Дано run Landscape "Sculpt mode"
Дано run Landscape "Tool: Splines"
Дано run Landscape "Spline width: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline width: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline width: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline width: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline width: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline width: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline side falloff: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline side falloff: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline side falloff: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline side falloff: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline side falloff: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline side falloff: smaller"
Дано run Landscape "Spline side falloff: smaller"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.001,-1,0.001
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 6300,9000,-1906
Дано run Landscape "Spline: add control point at viewport centre"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 9282,9000,-1906
Дано run Landscape "Spline: add control point at viewport centre"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 12300,9000,-1906
Дано run Landscape "Spline: add control point at viewport centre"
Дано run Landscape "Create Layer Info"
Дано run Landscape "Sculpt mode"
Дано run Landscape "Tool: Splines"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 9282,5000,-8000
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.55,0.84
Дано state
Тогда-вид base the road band through the hill in the base material, no paint on it
Когда run Landscape "Spline paint layer: next"
Когда run Landscape "Spline paint layer: next"
Когда state
Тогда-вид 0_painted the road band shows the new layer's swatch colour, its edges fading softly over the side falloff
# Undo before the save (reopening a scene starts a fresh history), then Redo to save the painted road.
Когда run Action "Undo"
Когда run Action "Undo"
Когда state
Тогда-вид 2_undo the road keeps its shape but shows the base material again (identical to base)
Когда run Action "Redo"
Когда run Action "Redo"
Когда run Action "Save Scene"
Когда run Scene "Open Scene G3_TwoTerrains.desce"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 9282,5000,-8000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.55,0.84
Когда state
Тогда-вид 1_reopen identical to 0_painted after the saved scene is reopened
